# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - EVENT 016 KRUGER DIRECTORATE WINDOW
# ============================================================================
# Read-only decision-category dashboard. Ordinary decisions remain the action
# surface; this window exposes the four public values, broad Control, Kruger's
# synchronized identity, facilities, foreign pressure, sovereignty, and the
# nonterminal Singularity build state without revealing hidden causal values.
# ============================================================================

